        <p source="#source-2096-2272"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2096-2117"><rb>常陸</rb><rt>ひたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2117-2135">真壁郡太田村</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-2135-2189" corresp="#source-2141-2189"><seg source="#source-2135-2141">大字</seg></hi><seg source="#source-2189-2195">野殿</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-2195-2243" corresp="#source-2198-2243"><seg source="#source-2195-2198">字</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2243-2270"><rb>唐米</rb><rt>とうぼし</rt></ruby></p>
